  "title": "He wasn't looking at me",
  "lyrics": [
    "Verse 1:",
    "He wasn't looking at me,",
    "when He took me in.",
    "He wasn't looking at my heart",
    "that was blacked by sin.",
    "He was looking at the blood,",
    "flowing rich and free.",
    "That precious blood,",
    "that covers me."
  ],
